# Travel summary

The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR [[cite:obs-842a4695a3fcf4144180eb7357b69c325544eb3b "The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR."]].

Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director [[cite:obs-06ad91ffcdb7ee2827f498cb68e7e0c43be01676 "Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director."]].
